{"v3_603711c5127909940422d43f":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さり、ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46 二期生の遠藤光莉です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobbw6qCN.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobLmTl7B.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ+｡::ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.:ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.｡ﾟ:;｡+ﾟ+｡:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8日からから配信になりますLeminoさん「ちょこさく #288」に出演しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は「What's KAZOKU？」選抜メンバーから6人でヒット祈願を行いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ごとながら、今まで参加したことがなったので、今回が\"初ヒット祈願\"となり、念願が叶って本当に嬉しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒット祈願成功なるのか…！\nぜひご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ+｡::ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.:ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.｡ﾟ:;｡+ﾟ+｡:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、19:00〜TBS 「CDTV ライブ！ライブ！」さんに出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「What's KAZOKU？」初披露です✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年ぶりの「CDTV ライブ！ライブ！」、たくさん見つけていただけるように頑張りますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ててね👀✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後は22:00に櫻坂46 OFFICIAL YouTube CHANNELにて、15枚目シングル「What's KAZOKU？」のMVも公開されます！🏠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに😉✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ+｡::ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.:ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.｡ﾟ:;｡+ﾟ+｡:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もブログを読んでいただきありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のブログも読んでいただけたら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#hikarinblog"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光莉🦋"}],"source":"official"},"sba-keyaki-15438":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんわん🐶⭐︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 本日、5月30日発売の「月刊エンタメ」さんに\n ふーちゃん、(斎藤冬優花)と2人での取材をして頂きました✨✨\n \n 4月のANNIVERSARY LIVEの話や、2人の理想のLIVEのセットリストなど考えてたくさん話させて頂きました!^^\n いつも、ふーちゃんと取材をさせて頂くと話したいことや伝えたいことが2人ともたくさんありすぎて溢れてしまうんです笑笑💦\n 今回もたくさんの方に見て頂きたいです^^\n \n \n \n \n \n ではっ^^\n 告知でした(小声🤭🐕)\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYM0ZH4TQ0HV0PYEPTFKC87","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 石森虹花🌈🌼"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6260":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nHello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎レポだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント。いつもありがと、嬉しいぜよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやblog見てても、コメントなかったら、\nその人の感想？\n気持ち？\nわかんないけど blogについて、\nコメントくれると、\nなんかうれしー！\n読んでくれてる！って思うし、その人の気持ちもわかるしっ！\n繋がってるって思って心がホッコリするの..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、前のblogで、\nコメントのこと\nコンメント\nってかいてしまったーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで ？なんで？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントって書いたつもりだったのにー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちくしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私というものは、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来上がったblogを読み返したはずなのに......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬおーーーーーっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこれはあれだね！あれだよ！\n今後気を付けよう←ん？普通のことだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、7月29日は、長崎でイベントがあったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎はなかなか行く機会がないので、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この機会に知っていただけたかたがいると公平に思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃう！光栄に思いますやっ！\nん？\nう〜ん嬉しく思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつものかたもいたり、\n久しぶりのかたもいたり、\nもーーーっありが10ぴきありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい笑って〜〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、衣装、黒い靴だったので、\n太陽の熱を吸収して、足めっちゃ暑かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか足の裏の皮が向けた感じで、\nずっとヒリヒリしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは大丈夫でしたか？\n暑さに体調崩さなかったですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？\n心配です...まあやパワーを送るね!!\n皆さんが元気でありますように...エイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏では、次に出演する、ダンスを踊る子たちが沢山いた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまあやたちの出演前とか出演後とか、その人たちが手振ってくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくてニヤニヤしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って下さい！\nって言ってくれたから、まあやも\n頑張って下さい\nって言っちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうその女の子とは友達だッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点は\n自分たちで皆様を盛り上げなければならないのに、\n皆様が盛り上がってくれて、\n嬉しくて自分が盛り上がってしまうという点です......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだだけど、がんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援が聞こえたよ!!\nいつも支えてくれて本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nホテルは皆一人部屋でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理矢理、\n雲ちゃん(美雲さん)を誘いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しい雲ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、温泉があったので、\n岩瀬のゆみこさんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩瀬のゆみこさん！\n源の頼朝\n小野の妹子\n織田の信長←これは違うか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"織田信長そのままやっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっまぁ、岩瀬のゆみこさん！と畠中のせいらさんと、斎藤のちはるさんと温泉いきました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お湯熱すぎた！\nお湯にはいるの手こずっていたら\n皆サッサと入っていった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩瀬のゆみこさんなんか\n『お湯温くね？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにゃろー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆すっぴんでもキレイだったよ〜\nウキャ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山人がいたから静かに入ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だっていい子だも〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、帰りの飛行機は、ねねころの隣でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと英語の勉強を手伝ってくれたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（レッスン前とかにも、若月ちゃんと、深川ちゃんと、いくちゃんにおしえてもらったりするんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ）\n感謝です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでねっ、ねねころちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛行機が離陸するとき溢れんばかりに瞳に涙を浮かべてました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃわゆいぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは飛行機こわい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-4408":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日と今日は名古屋で握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会は初お披露目の曲ばかりでした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんズすごい可愛かったな〜〜( ◜︎◡︎◝︎ )♡てちも、パフォーマンスに見入ってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「語るなら未来を」という曲はダンスがすごくかっこいいので、早くみなさんに見せたかったんですヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとお披露目できて良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひらがなけやきも初お披露目でした。いよいよ始まったんだなと気が引き締まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で想像以上に多くの方にひらがなけやきへの暖かい言葉をかけていただきすごく驚いたしすごくありがたかったです。\nもっと頑張らなきゃいけないし、自分が不甲斐なくて悔しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の途中で、来てくださった皆さんに笑顔を見せることができなくなってしまい本当に申し訳ありませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、一緒に頑張ろうねと言ってくださり、本当に感激しました。\n絶対絶対頑張るので、これからもよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握レーンのペアはふーちゃんでした!すっごく楽しかった〜\nふーちゃんファンの方も私に会いに来てくださった方も、本当にありがとうございました(´｡･_･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、欅坂のグッズ販売スタートしたみたいです!\nみたけど、すごく可愛いデザインでした∠︎(　˙-˙ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHA5M4QM5ARPS5DGP42S6CE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてみてくれよな"}